# Agent Workflow

Use the local source-of-truth files before implementation.

## Flow

```text
intake -> read canon -> checkpoint -> implementation -> verification -> evidence -> memory
```

## Rules

- One main agent owns final edits.
- Subagents are read-only unless a checkpoint grants narrow disjoint write scope.
- Non-trivial work needs an active checkpoint.
- Every checkpoint needs scope, anti-scope, verification, evidence path and stop condition.
- Missing product/architecture decisions go to `memory/QUESTIONS.md`.
- Repeated lessons go to `memory/LESSONS.md` before promotion.
